WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.643
"Did you hear?" Dipper asked.

2
00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:14.322
"Hear what?" Eddy asked.

3
00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:19.243
"We're having a talent show!" Dipper said.

4
00:00:19.244 --> 00:00:23.449
"I will play music in it!"

5
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:28.011
Dipper played her music.

6
00:00:28.012 --> 00:00:41.299
She spun around and sang.

7
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:47.469
"What will you do, Jeb?" Eddy asked.

8
00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:50.537
"Watch this!" Jeb said.

9
00:00:50.538 --> 00:00:59.305
Jeb rolled to the dirt area.

10
00:00:59.306 --> 00:01:02.196
He lifted a big rock.

11
00:01:02.197 --> 00:01:05.404
"Wow!" everyone said.

12
00:01:05.405 --> 00:01:10.099
"I will lift big things," Jeb said.

13
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:15.312
"I can tell jokes," Poppy said.

14
00:01:15.313 --> 00:01:18.353
"And I can do balloon tricks!"

15
00:01:18.354 --> 00:01:21.675
Poppy's trunk popped open.

16
00:01:21.676 --> 00:01:25.823
Balloons floated out.

17
00:01:25.824 --> 00:01:28.335
"Cool!" Gasser said.

18
00:01:28.336 --> 00:01:31.312
"I will drive over things."

19
00:01:31.313 --> 00:01:34.047
Brumm, brumm!

20
00:01:34.048 --> 00:01:43.122
Gasser drove over a dirt pile.

21
00:01:43.123 --> 00:01:49.344
"What will you do, Eddy?" Jeb asked.

22
00:01:49.345 --> 00:01:58.326
Eddy frowned. "I don't know."

